al (best move on the real engine); after a failed attempt, Try Again opens with the coach guiding the first raid (retry assist). GHOST DUELS (async PvP, a recorded real run replayed exactly) are the breathers of chapters 2, 3, 5 and 6 (21, 32, 54, 63) plus the spike 53 and the Ghost Gate 51.","intent":"Breather after the thriller, and the first Ghost Duel: a friend raided this same friendly mat (seven on, rookie corners, bonus line open) and their recorded score is on the board. Beat it in 4 raids. No defending, no clock pressure — the ghost replays exactly, so it is a pure score chase. Aha: the bonus hop is free points while all seven stand; take it before your touches thin the mat.","mechanics":["ghost duel","bonus line","toe touch","hand touch","dubki"],"optimal":null,"branching":18,"trap":null,"explored":40000},{"n":22,"grid":"[Full Match · boss · Ch2 District Cup] OPP MAT: A T T B T T A · grip 0.82 · KEY: A ankle-catcher (Toe/hop/Dubki risky), T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky), B blocker (Dash risky)\nMY SIDE: o o o o o o o (7 on mat)\nFLOW: alternate raids 30:00→40:00 (~14 raids in all, ~7 each) · start score 16-17\nMY MOVES: hand toe bonus walk dash dubki pull | DEFENCE: ankle thigh block hold\nCPU RAIDER \"District captain\": s 0.50 · Easy · touches hand/toe/bonus · home walk/dash/dubki · up to 2 touches\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1A:h25/t39 2T:h51/t28 3T:h52/t13 4B:h42/t14 5T:h52/t13 6T:h51/t28 7A:h25/t39 bonus:48 | home after 1 touch: walk 63%, dash 49%, dubki 49% | after 2: walk 74%, dash 59%, dubki 60% | if held: pull 40%\nREAD (gem % stop, made by the cover): vs his touch — hand: ankle 20/thigh 52; toe: ankle 53/thigh 19; bonus: ankle 32/thigh 22 | vs his way home — walk: ankle 21/thigh 37/block 27; dash: ankle 34/thigh 18/block 52; dubki: ankle 38/thigh 6/block 9 | his touch lands 82% if untackled\nGOAL: win by 1+ | STARS: Win by 4; Win by 7\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 36/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 77/1