to you. Score 2 Kicks and 3 points in 4 raids.","mechanics":["backward kick","rusher defenders","hand touch","toe touch","dash home"],"optimal":null,"branching":22,"trap":null,"explored":40000},{"n":24,"grid":"[Raid Puzzle · teach · Ch3 State League] OPP MAT: T T C C T T T · grip 0.77 · KEY: T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky), C chain link (walk/Dash risky when paired)\nMY SIDE: o o o o o o o (7 on mat)\nFLOW: you raid 4x\nMY MOVES: hand toe kick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1T:h47/t9 2T:h50/t14 3C:h33/t17 4C:h33/t17 5T:h50/t14 6T:h57/t12 7T:h47/t9 bonus:17 | home after 1 touch: walk 71%, dash 48%, dubki 17% | after 2: walk 81%, dash 58%, dubki 22% | if held: pull 40%, lunge 40%\nGOAL: score 4 | FAIL: raider out 3x | STARS: Escape a hold; Score 5 points\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 40/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 91/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the player raids and defends in turns). OPP MAT = 7 defender slots, left corner → right corner ('-' = out). Defender traits: o rookie; T Thigh-holder (beats Hand Touch + walking home); A Ankle-catcher (beats Toe Touch, bonus hop, Dubki); B Blocker (midline wall, beats the Dash home); R Rusher (charges: beats hops and touches; a Backward Kick tags him); C Chain link (two adjacent C's chain: beat walk/dash home, Dubki ducks under); K rival captain (strong at everything except his one listed weakness). Danger comes from the target and his neighbours and grows with every touch already made. SCOUTED: only on trials whose OPP MAT row says SCOUTED, a move used on my previous raid is read — its gem shows a SCOUTED tag and the higher % (capped at ~8 points); rows that say 'no scouting' never show the tag. READ rows = the % the game shows on each option gem, never a recommendation (h/t/k = Hand/Toe/Kick touch on that slot). My raid: touch beats (7 s) + optional bonus hop (5 s, 6+ defenders) + way home (6 s) inside the 30 s raid clock; held 