evives one, the 3rd straight empty raid is Do-or-Die. CPU: skill s, Easy/Medium/Hard brain. PROOF = validate's simulated players on the real engine over 40/100 match seeds. ASSISTS: 3 free coach hints per trial (best move on the real engine); after a failed attempt, Try Again opens with the coach guiding the first raid (retry assist). GHOST DUELS (async PvP, a recorded real run replayed exactly) are the breathers of chapters 2, 3, 5 and 6 (21, 32, 54, 63) plus the spike 53 and the Ghost Gate 51.","intent":"Teach the Super Tackle: you have only 3 on the mat, so any tackle is worth 2 — but he goes for two touches, and lose all 3 and the all-out gives them +2. Choose WHICH of your three makes the tackle — the one beside his target (cover), never the man he touches. Aha: three defenders are a threat, not a weakness. Land a Super Tackle within 4 raids and concede no more than 2 (his two-touch raid can cost two at once).","mechanics":["super tackle","all-out","ankle hold","thigh hold","block (defensive wall)","defender rush"],"optimal":2,"branching":10,"trap":0,"explored":27},{"n":27,"grid":"[Raid Puzzle · twist · Ch3 State League] OPP MAT: o R T R T o R · grip 0.65 · KEY: o rookie, R rusher (touch/hop risky, Kick safe), T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky) · SCOUTED: a move from your last raid is tagged on its gem and ~7 pts more likely held (capped, same on every mat)\nMY SIDE: o o o o o o o (7 on mat)\nFLOW: you raid 4x\nMY MOVES: hand toe kick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1o:h14/t13 2R:h34/t21/k9 3T:h43/t22 4R:h43/t22/k11 5T:h38/t16 6o:h28/t15 7R:h21/t19/k4 bonus:53 | home after 1 touch: walk 42%, dash 18%, dubki 23% | after 2: walk 52%, dash 23%, dubki 29% | if held: pull 42%, lunge 41%\nGOAL: score 4, 1x kick | FAIL: raider out 2x | STARS: Score with 2 kicks; Never get caught\nPROOF (validate, real engine, fresh match seeds): a competent player won 37/40 (best 3★), a mid-skill player 71/100","legend":"KABADDI RAID TRIAL (content unit; the p