e mat/raider. MY SIDE roles: A ankle / T thigh specialist, C cover, K anchor, R rusher. Rules: 1 point per touch, tackle 1 (Super Tackle 2 with ≤3 defenders), bonus only with 6+ defenders, all-out +2, every point revives one, the 3rd straight empty raid is Do-or-Die. CPU: skill s, Easy/Medium/Hard brain. PROOF = validate's simulated players on the real engine over 40/100 match seeds. ASSISTS: 3 free coach hints per trial (best move on the real engine); after a failed attempt, Try Again opens with the coach guiding the first raid (retry assist). GHOST DUELS (async PvP, a recorded real run replayed exactly) are the breathers of chapters 2, 3, 5 and 6 (21, 32, 54, 63) plus the spike 53 and the Ghost Gate 51.","intent":"Twist: a two-touch raider — after the first touch he turns for a second defender, so the defender in range changes mid-raid. Switch to whoever covers the new target (the tap-select is instant). Aha: defend the raider's NEXT target, not the last one. Stop 2 of 4 and concede no more than 3.","mechanics":["defender switch","hold specialists","anchor","ankle hold","thigh hold","block (defensive wall)"],"optimal":4,"branching":13,"trap":0,"explored":986},{"n":40,"grid":"[Match · spike · Ch4 Auction Hall] OPP MAT: A T R o R T A · grip 1.08 · KEY: A ankle-catcher (Toe/hop/Dubki risky), T thigh-holder (Hand/walk risky), R rusher (touch/hop risky, Kick safe), o rookie · no scouting on this trial (no SCOUTED tags)\nMY SIDE: A T o K o T A (7 on mat)\nFLOW: alternate: 5 raids / 5 defences\nMY MOVES: hand toe kick bonus walk dash dubki pull lunge | DEFENCE: ankle thigh block rush hold\nCPU RAIDER \"League star\": s 0.68 · Medium · touches hand/toe · home walk/dash/dubki · up to 1 touch\nREAD (gem % held) touch: 1A:h31/t47 2T:h55/t42 3R:h50/t33/k14 4o:h35/t33 5R:h50/t33/k14 6T:h55/t42 7A:h31/t47 bonus:77 | home after 1 touch: walk 60%, dash 29%, dubki 63% | after 2: walk 71%, dash 37%, dubki 74% | if held: pull 37%, lunge 36%\nREAD (gem % stop, made by the cover): vs 